Review checklist
----------------
   extra_report_congestion*.rpt contain valid hotspot/overflow data or command failures to fix.
   pd_matrix_symmetry.rpt shows a grid-snapped sandwich region and oscillator keepouts.
   pd_matrix_decap.rpt shows DECAP25HD/DECAP15HD insertion inside or around the PD region.
   phase_mesh_route_intent.rpt shows whether Innovus accepted phase-net route attributes.
   extra_phase_mesh_audit.rpt lists only intended phase-like nets for the METTP exception.
